t(2, 395, """We are still with the saying of our Great Lord, sanctified be His names, in Surah Qaf: “They shall have whatever they will therein, and with Us there is more.”

Know, my Muslim brother, my Muslim sister, that the will (mashi'ah) which our Great Lord, sanctified be His names, mentioned as belonging to the people of Paradise by the text of the noble verse has another side besides the one I explained in my previous post. I did not wish to put it in the same post, lest the reading grow long and minds scatter. Now let us reflect on a very important meaning in the matter of the will of the people of Paradise.

To want (iradah) a thing requires logic in it .. If I said to you, “I want to fly to the moon today, will you come with me?”, you would tell me this wanting is not possible, because wanting a thing requires that the wanting can be realised by a creature who cannot break the norm .. So people are used to saying: I want to go to the market .. I want to marry .. I want to buy food, and so on; all of these are obtained through causes, after the granting of success by Allah the Exalted, the Great, sanctified be His names. But will, in respect of the creature, has come in Paradise as an absolute, open will .. They shall have whatever they will, where there are no restraining rules, no disabling limits and no obstructing laws of this world. Since the matter in Paradise is will and not wanting, this shows that it breaks the earthly laws. This we all know as Muslims, for everyone knows that Paradise is not governed by the laws of physics; so will there is more correct than wanting. For if we look at the will of the Lord, sanctified be His names and attributes, we find that His will and His wanting are one; both express the overpowering of every cause and every obstacle. Our Lord says in a verse of His Book: “And We wanted to bestow favour on those who were oppressed in the land, and make them leaders and make them the inheritors.” The wanting of our Great Lord is will, because it is in respect of the Great Lord, sanctified be His names and attributes and exalted greatly. As for the servant in this world, when he wants something, either the causes of success gather for him by Allah's granting of success, or they are withheld from him by Allah's wisdom regarding him. He has neither will nor wanting; the servant speaks of wanting a thing only to show the direction of his effort and his aim, not because his wanting must inevitably be realised. So the servant's wanting becomes merely an announcement of his desire for something to come about for him. As for the wanting of the Lord, our Great Lord, when our Lord, sanctified be His names, mentions it, He, exalted greatly, means the “Kaf and Nun” of His inevitable decrees; for Allah's decrees do not seek causes and pursue them in order to come about; rather all His decrees are realised, whether expressed by the word wanting or by the word will.

Accordingly, O noble ones, in Paradise the wanting that was given to the servant in this world, and which did not guarantee the realisation of what he wants, turns into will. Here, because of the attribute of will that is distinct from wanting in respect of the servant but not distinct in respect of the Great Lord, and because the servant possesses will in Paradise, the servant comes to have, by Allah's permission, authority over things by Allah's will and wanting. He does not need the wanting that is in respect of the servant and particular to him, because, being the servant's, it does not suffice to bring things about with certainty; and because he tasted its kind in this world, where it was given to him deficient, not guaranteeing in all its cases that things come about, so that his wishes swung between fulfilment and prevention. Therefore it is lifted from him in Paradise, because in Paradise there is never any taste of deprivation in anything that concerns the servant. So it is replaced with will, which dominates the causes and does not wait for the cause to interact with what is sought. Thus will carries a very important meaning, which is what I want to make clear here: it means the realisation of the unimaginable, the illogical and the unnatural, things not among what the people of this world are used to in the abode of this world. From here we must understand the blessing of will in Paradise in this respect: that it realises for us, by Allah's permission, everything that crosses the mind, even if it is wholly contrary to all the laws of the abode of this world and to all the conceptions of reason and logic. This is what we in fact know of the nature and reality of Paradise, which is hidden from no one. What I wanted here is to link what you know of the reality of Paradise and the realisation of every wonder in it with the blessing of will that a human being, man or woman, is given in Paradise, so that the picture of wishes in Paradise becomes clearer and plainer, and a person understands the nature of his existence there and detaches entirely, in understanding and reflection, from the attachments of this world in mind, intellect and thinking. Then he knows that what is there in Paradise is everything you will, whatever it may be, with one single rule in Paradise to which all the people of Paradise are subject without exception: the rule guaranteeing that what you will shall not harm another of the people of Paradise. This is the only rule standing in Paradise. And this does not mean that the will is deficient; for the Lord, sanctified be His names and attributes, in His holy, exalted Self, forbade injustice to Himself, and He is able to impose that on His servants. So one cannot imagine a human will in the abode of the Hereafter that is not subject to the law of protecting the other.

In conclusion: will, under the will of Allah the Exalted, in Paradise, apart from the rule I mentioned, will be a green light for the realisation of all the soul's desires that are unusual, unimaginable, impossible here, unnatural, illogical. A person comes and says: “I want to move to the abode of the Hijrah and watch the Prophet ﷺ and his Companions for 11 years in the abode of the Hijrah, spend the full 11 years with them and watch everything on the ground.” Do you think this is not possible? If you think this is not possible, it means the idea of this post has not fully reached you.""")

t(2, 2470, """O extinguished flower .. All the cities of the earth have taken their share except you .. How long you have wept .. and suffered .. and slept with tears on your cheeks .. Your garment always torn .. your soul forever hungry and thirsty .. All the great cities of the world have blossomed except you .. Your time is drawing near, by the permission of Allah the Exalted""")

t(3, 1140, """After the third great war, the relatively small states will have no value that would call for a joint campaign between the Romans and the Muslims. Unfortunately many read without reflection! The Prophet ﷺ says: “You will make a secure peace with the Romans; then you and they will fight an enemy behind them, and you will be safe and take spoils.”

The time of the secure peace is not in these years of ours; it happens in a time, an era, a life and a stage that in no way resembles our life now under the present world order. Some said: Iran! And some said: India. As for Iran, it will not even come out of the world war as a power, such that a whole Islamic Ummah of a billion and a half people would ally with Europe and those who orbit it, two billion people, in order to fight Iran? Something stranger than strange! As for India, texts have come about it making clear that it will be completely shattered and will pose no threat to anyone. The enemy, then, is China, and Allah knows best. It will have come out of the war utterly exhausted and shattered, its global power fallen, having become a state resembling old China: it manufactures and does not frighten, it manufactures and does not threaten, and is no longer a threat to anyone. So what is the reason for the Muslims and the Romans allying against it in an easy war in which they take spoils and suffer no losses? And are safe? The truth is that this is an entirely hidden unseen .. Our knowledge of the reason for the outbreak of the war is a matter wholly hidden from us; so it is subject only to reasoned opinion, always referring knowledge back to Allah the Great, our Lord, sanctified be His names, magnified in the heavens and on earth and exalted greatly.

The upshot is that the Romans are always on their old ways. The desire to dominate the world! This desire never stops with them, not even for a single second. And the upshot is that they are at peace with the Muslims because of what will befall them in the Third World War; in that peace of theirs they are at a loss, for the Muslims no longer consult them on what to do and with whom to ally. For at least 200 years the West has been controlling the Muslims directly and effectively, which is a very long time. The West will not be able to forget its great victories over the Muslims for 200 years; this is a long time, hard to forget. So when the secure peace comes, and the Muslims become fully independent in their life and their decisions, and become their own masters for the first time in centuries, not just 200 years, this is something the West is not used to; it is regarded as a challenge to it, and it is very disturbing to the West.

Since that is the situation, with the Muslims open to all nations including the Chinese, cooperating in the world with everyone to build their shattered countries, to provide a dignified life for the citizens of their Islamic world, to dry the tears of the Muslims and to let them live the dignified life they deserve, all of this, for the Romans, is not a good thing!

Accordingly, it is natural that the Romans cause a conflict to break out which the Muslims are forced to enter in order to protect their borders, their existence and their new entity. But perhaps the Romans at that time will play their many games, on the political, economic, military, security and media levels, to get rid of the Muslims and the Chinese together at one time. And perhaps they will be surprised on that day that their plan is uncovered and their games exposed; they will be at a loss and will leave the battle without achieving the goal of eliminating the Muslims. With the failure of their attempt and their planning, they will provoke a Muslim so that he kills one of their soldiers. Although the killing of a soldier never means waging a war, they will take it as a pretext to send 960 thousand soldiers to fight the Muslims. Is the response to a soldier killed by mistake the sending of 960 thousand soldiers from Europe? The truth is that the failure to eliminate the Muslims in the allied war against China will be the reason for seeking another way to eliminate the Muslims. If the Muslims escape the games of the war with China, then there must be a solution to get rid of them and to end the truce and the peace!""")

t(4, 1095, """The Messenger of Allah ﷺ said: “You will make a secure peace with the Romans” .. Comment: not because they are kind .. but because they are forced .. The result: they lift their hand from the Islamic world .. The result: the liberation of the Islamic world and its development with wealth that no nation has ever obtained before in history .. 1407 years of conspiring against the Muslims so that they do not develop .. In 9 years, with wealth, the Ummah is built, as compensation for 1407 years of conspiracies .. In 9 years the Ummah has no time to build a cumulative industry, though in my reading I am sure, Allah willing, that in 9 years the Ummah is able to build the basic industries that make it not in need of everything from abroad. The West will enter a financial crisis which its holy book has named: the years of the great tribulation! In the seven years of tribulation that will strike the West, it will be in very dire need of wealth .. (of gold), so that famines do not occur in it, and so that it can secure food for the people united under the banner of Rome.""")

t(4, 2500, """One of the brothers asked about the city of the Messenger of Allah ﷺ — may our souls be a ransom for it and for its dweller, upon him be blessings and peace — he asked about its state in the second global era of Islam. No doubt the hadith that has come in al-Bukhari, narrated by Abu Hurayrah, may Allah be pleased with him, is a hadith that foretells something in the future of our Ummah concerning Medina the Radiant, and I will take it up with explanation, by the permission of Allah the Exalted.""")

t(5, 215, """I heard the Messenger of Allah ﷺ say: “They will leave Medina in the best state it ever was; none will come to it but the seekers — meaning the beasts and birds that seek food — and the last to be gathered will be two shepherds of Muzaynah heading for Medina, calling out to their sheep; they will find it a wilderness, until, when they reach Thaniyyat al-Wada', they fall upon their faces.”
Narrator: Abu Hurayrah | Scholar: al-Bukhari | Source: Sahih al-Bukhari

The hadith is clear that Medina will be left. The wording that came in it is not: “the Ummah perishes, so Medina is emptied of its people” .. nor: “the pleasant wind comes and takes the souls of the last believing men and women, so Medina is emptied of its people” .. nor: “a plague falls on Medina, so Medina is emptied of its people” .. nor: “an enemy overpowers the people of Medina and forces them to leave it” .. There is nothing of this in the hadith .. Rather the hadith says that it is left, meaning its people leave it of their own will, without hardship, severity or fear, because he ﷺ said: “in the best state it ever was”; that is, it has construction, growth, a pleasant life and everything that gives a person the best life imaginable! So why do its people leave it until it is completely empty?

This hadith does not speak of the period of the second global era of Islam, the nine years in which Jerusalem is the capital of the world, as being the outcome of Medina's emptying of its inhabitants. But the second global era of Islam, because of the desire of all Muslims to live in Palestine specifically, will make people decrease in Medina and elsewhere; they will migrate and settle permanently in Palestine, and this will reduce the population of Medina. Yet Medina will not be entirely emptied of its inhabitants in the second global era of Islam; its population will only decline. For the Prophet ﷺ said of the second global era of Islam, shortly before the emergence of the Dajjal, that the Ummah in it will be great and will enjoy a blessing it has never enjoyed. And the Prophet ﷺ always and forever chose every word and expression he spoke with a precision unmatched among the Arabs of old and until the last Arab perishes. When he ﷺ meant a small number of people he would say “a band” or “a people”; but in the hadith he said: “My Ummah will enjoy in it a blessing the like of which they have never enjoyed.” Since he ﷺ said of the period of Imam Mahdi's rule that it is a period in which his Ummah will enjoy blessing, his Ummah is not 10 thousand people .. From this side we clearly understand that he ﷺ is speaking of an Ummah of great number. The Americans are called a nation only because they are about 400 million; the Arabs are called a nation, the Muslims are called a nation, the Russians are called a nation, the Indians are called a nation, the Chinese are called a nation .. and so on; this is the meaning of Ummah .. And since the Ummah will enjoy a blessing it never enjoyed, it enjoys it as an Ummah, meaning its number is large, and this rules out Medina being empty of people. In the hadith there is an indication that when Medina is emptied and left and all people leave it, it becomes completely empty while in the finest possible state. This means that in the second global era of Islam an infrastructure will be built in Medina that will make the Prophet's ﷺ words about it (in the best state it ever was) come true, such that in the Prophet's ﷺ description there is a subtle indication that it is built in a way that was not in it before and never was in it before .. As for the reason it is emptied of people, I find no reason for it, and Allah knows best, except the annihilation that will strike all nations. Hadiths weak in chain came in al-Fitan of Nu'aym saying that those who will be with the Prophet of Allah Jesus, peace be upon him, are 17 thousand. They are weak in chain, but there are many hadiths that help us accept those weak-chained hadiths about the numbers of Muslims in the region, or perhaps in the whole world: they are 17 thousand in Palestine and a few thousand here and there, until they dwindle by death over time, so that Egypt becomes desolate, Palestine desolate, all of al-Sham desolate, Iraq a void, the whole Arabian Peninsula desolate, and North Africa, Sudan, Turkey, Iran, Pakistan, Afghanistan, Africa, Australia and the two Americas either a void or with a small number of inhabitants .. All of them a void or a very, very few human beings. The Romans remain in that time the most numerous people in the whole world, as came in the hadith: more than the Chinese, the Indians, the Muslim Arabs, the non-Arab Muslims, the Africans in Africa and the Westerners in the two Americas; and upon the remnants of nations and civilisations the Hour comes.

This is my understanding of Medina the Radiant being emptied of people while it is in the most beautiful condition any city can be in terms of infrastructure .. The answer: first, because many of its inhabitants will move to live permanently in Palestine, so the number will fall in the second global era of Islam; and then, after the second global era of Islam, because 99% of people — Allah alone knows best the proportion — have died, and Allah knows best.""")

t(6, 640, """The provision of will for the kings and queens of Paradise! The complete opening of destiny!

Our Great Lord, sanctified be His names, says in His Noble Book in Surah al-Takwir: “And you do not will unless Allah wills, the Lord of the worlds.”
And our Great Lord, sanctified be His names, says in Surah Qaf: “They shall have whatever they will therein, and with Us there is more.”
The first is for the people of this world, and the second is for the people of Paradise.

Allah the Great, our Generous Lord, whom we must love for a million thousand and one sound reasons, has given the people of Paradise a will and has withheld will from the people of this world.

So in this world there occurs what we love and what we do not love; and in this world, if we love something, it is very likely not to happen, because all its states are turned to the will of Allah the Exalted alone, since it is an abode of testing, not an abode of settlement. As for Paradise, Allah the Exalted has created for its people a will in it, under His will and under His wanting, most certainly. But He, sanctified be His names, magnified in the heavens and on earth and exalted greatly, has released for the people of Paradise a will of their own with which they act. This is something they never obtained in the life of this world; it is a new wanting they did not experience in their worldly life! And this wanting is a blessing which, if the people who worship Allah the Exalted only for the sake of Paradise and its bliss were to contemplate it, their minds would reel merely from thinking about what I am saying, and they would strive in worship with the utmost striving.

Is the will of the people of Paradise in Paradise — we seek refuge in Allah, our Great Lord — separate from the will of Allah? Exalted is Allah greatly. It is definitely a will under the will of Allah the Exalted; but He, glorified and exalted, has permitted it and granted it. It is a green light, open always, at every time and moment, in every state and in every circumstance: that in Paradise you have your own will, such that everything you will is realised for you, not only what you want. For wanting may yield something resembling what you wanted, but will yields the exact match of what you wanted. You say “I want apples” and an apple comes to you that is not 100% as you wanted it to be. But when you say “I will an apple”, here you are speaking of a clear, detailed wanting, and it comes to you exactly as you want, not deficient and with no flaw that makes it spoiled in any of its aspects. You say: “I want my son so-and-so, with whom, because of life's preoccupations, my life slipped away and I did not enjoy his childhood; he grew up and I did not live my fatherhood or my motherhood with him as I wished in the abode of this world.” And he comes to you in his form, his face, his body and the age that you willed, with the very same behaviour he had when he was a child in this world, with the very things about him that made you laugh and made you happy in the abode of this world, and with his very same way of speaking and behaving!

And people, unfortunately — our Muslim brothers and sisters — very many of them do not grasp this truth about Paradise: that it is an abode not governed by the rules of the abode of this world. Relationships in it are not as in this world. In Paradise, your relationship with your parents is a relationship of believers among perhaps trillions of believers of the people of Paradise, all of you classified under one classification. The man in Paradise has a will, and the woman has a will, and there are no impositions. Among what has spread in the minds of men and women is their assumption that Paradise contains impositions, as though it were imposed on the man that his wife who is with him in this world be his wife in Paradise, or imposed on the woman that her husband who is with her in this world be with her in Paradise. People have founded mistaken ideas on hadiths whose chains are not sound. And in His saying, sanctified be His names: “They shall have whatever they will therein, and with Us there is more” there is a clarification that is not ambiguous to all who reflect on the speech of Allah the Exalted. Paradise is the abode of will, and the earth is the abode of decrees. Among the decrees of this world we live being turned about, because we are in a test. But amid the will of Paradise we live without being turned about by trials, because there we have a will that was given to us as a gift and bestowed on us as a blessing and a favour from a Great Lord who wills for us there in Paradise, and so we will. When we will, He wills for us what we willed and withholds from us nothing that we will, because we will under His will; sanctified be every name that is His.""")

t(8, 1550, """The most important factory in the whole world! It is always promoted in the media as holding within its walls the most important machines and equipment in the whole world, and this is 100% true. But the question that is not raised or discussed in the media is: does it make sense that the most important factory in the whole world contains machines regarded as the most important in the whole world, and that those who made these machines (a European country) possess only those machines that are in this factory? And that they put all these machines they made — the latest technology man has known so far in chip manufacturing — put everything they made in this factory? Have the people of the world really come to live in naivety of this kind, with this degree of flattening of matters?

For years the factory has been promoted as the most important factory for humanity, and that an attempt to occupy Taiwan means a blow to all humanity and a disabling of the smart technology of all humanity. As if all the machines had been placed in Taiwan with its factory, and this factory contained all those machines, and if the factory were destroyed there would no longer be in the world even one extra machine anywhere in the world; whereas those machines are not even manufactured in Taiwan!

It is clear that the factory is being used, naively and trivially, as a false justification to prevent China from touching Taiwan or approaching it. It is a new, trivial practice in international politics. But the Western media, long accustomed to treating people's minds as stupid and taking people's minds for fools, still uses its same media methods in addressing people's minds with untrue news and information and presenting them as confirmed facts. So if the factory is struck, it will be said: “China has wrecked the world and ruined technology for people; China is criminal and revenge must be taken on it.” The ordinary citizen in America and Europe will begin to suffer deliberate interruptions in smart technology, and will lose his stock markets, his businesses and his prosperity, and all this because of a factory! So that the United States' plans for war on China turn into justified plans.

In the Second World War the United States allowed Japan to strike Pearl Harbor, and it seems that one day it will allow China to strike Taiwan. As for the factory, in truth it is not worth the price of the concrete it was built with, because the devices and machines in it exist in other places outside Taiwan.""")

t(9, 1030, """A Russian-European alliance is possible but not certain .. because the interactions of the future swing a great deal, owing to the historic pressure bearing on everything in the world. If the two sides do not ally against the United States, their alliance is possible and expected after the Third World War.""")

t(9, 2125, """The American National Security document .. I have just followed two of its clauses .. So far, what is being published as advice to the Europeans, who were stabbed according to the document, and what is being published as advice to the Japanese, Taiwanese, Koreans and Filipinos, who were also stabbed according to the document, is emotional advice performed by media that does not grasp the reality of this document, or part of which grasps it but does not want people to understand. But I will now speak in the tongue of the media, not in my own. Such as saying to the collapsing part of the alliance in the East, according to the document, “cooperate with China”, and saying to Europe “cooperate with Russia”: all this is emotional advice to keep people (the peoples) away from understanding what is going on, and it is of the kind of naive vengeful reactions. International politics does not work this way, because international politics is not a brawl in a street; but the media is keen to make the peoples think it is a brawl in a street. The Americans have decided to devour Central and South America, according to the document! And to form alliances there, so that the two Americas turn into one allied power because of the buried, virgin riches in the southern continent, according to the document. And this is Trump's problem, because he is a merchant (as the document tries to show him): he looks at international politics as goods, sacks of wheat, soybeans and sales. I had written about him in a post perhaps a year ago, when he was still in his first week in the White House, that it is impossible for a merchant to understand international politics, and I explained the problem of the merchant's mentality and its""")

t(10, 150, """catastrophic effect on international politics. (But is America run by one man?) The answer .... No .. a great many no's. For the post-Second World War alliances between the United States and Europe, between the United States and the Middle East, and between the United States and the islands of Japan, Taiwan, the Philippines and South Korea were not a commercial deal, and Trump knows that. Rather they were a strategy in which many political, security, military, economic, social, cultural, scientific and developmental details intertwine, and the military complex understands that. But of course, because the economy has since then been tied to the United States, we have reached 2025 and the allies are no longer useful to the United States from Trump's point of view, because Trump sees the world as a shop and a market; he sees it as nothing else. The American pampering of the American citizen since Bretton Woods 1944 — the whole world paid the price of this pampering, and even America itself today is reaping its results along with the world. In the first moments of the pampering, from 1944, the allies got a good share of it, so Japan, South Korea and Europe developed as a result of the alliance being tied to preference in industry, trade and development with the United States, the industrial train that was huge and terrifying in size at that time. The allies got good crumbs that helped them develop. But the choking taking place today in the world economy, which originally began from America and under its leadership, has dropped every interest the United States could obtain from the allies, from the point of view of Trump, who considers that the only interest he sees or believes in is (cash money). He sees nothing in the world but bundles of dollars: international politics is bundles of dollars, the economy is bundles of dollars, American and global national security is bundles of dollars, all classes and kinds of strategies, with all their theories, tools and targets, are bundles of dollars! This is what I spoke about when he came for the second term (and this is what Trump wants the world to believe about the United States: that it is ruled by a man who does not understand politics, in the hope that this will form a good interference with the making of politics and economy in the world)

According to this strategy of deception, the American document came out to tell the allies “you are no longer our allies”, and to show that the world is not changing but has in fact already changed. When I and you were writing here and all commenting and saying that the post-Second World War world order is collapsing, without any exaggeration, many in our world were sunk in sweet sleep! And did not grasp the meaning of the collapse of the world order. Today Trump is also announcing the undoing of his alliance with the Middle East and the handing over of the Middle East to the entity, and he has become convinced that the entity can rule the Middle East! For the thousandth time he tries to delude the world that he thinks wrongly, reads matters wrongly and works with the mind of a merchant, not the mind of a politician! The American document is a major global shock and a very huge political earthquake at world level, and this earthquake will not subside until it brings about real global changes, not illusions or fantasies. Europe is between making, within two years according to the document — between making a militarily great power, as he gave it a deadline for that while knowing it is a deadline unfit for implementation — and his pushing it to throw itself into Putin's arms, so that he rids himself for the time being of the pressure of the Ukrainian war on the United States. Knowing that his goal cannot be achieved, he uses the document to pressure the palaces of rule in Europe, nothing more. As for the islands of the eastern alliance with the United States — Japan, Taiwan, the Philippines and also South Korea — they too are now in a predicament for the time being, because of what appears in the document to be the United States abandoning them as a priority in defending them against China's ambitions. He is also using the document to blackmail the states of the eastern alliance as he blackmails Europe. And with all that is happening according to the document, we must realise that the announcement of a document does not necessarily mean that we are before a fact, does not necessarily mean that the document is truthful, and does not necessarily mean that the document is real!

It is easy to write a document on paper and publish it, but it is not easy to confirm that it is a real document .. So everything above that you have read in this post is nothing but an analysis of the document, not a confirmation of its seriousness!

Trump announces in the document that he will shift his attention to South America to strengthen his geopolitical position in his geographical surroundings. But I do not buy this talk, because it is talk that contradicts the ABC of international politics, and because I realise that he is most likely using the image of the merchant to try to convince China that he does not understand international politics — and he really is like that. At first glance, every one of us will say what I said at the beginning of this post; he will say: “Yes, he really is a merchant, and we have known since the start of his return to the White House that he will ruin everything because he does not understand international politics!” Yes, we will say that at first glance! In our initial reaction, when we speak of the policy of the United States through the person of the president and not through the military complex! And not through our awareness that several bodies rule the United States, the last of which is the president!

It is impossible that this document issued from the military complex, and the military complex is not so weak as to have imposed on it this document, which is not worth the ink it was printed with — not worth it at the level of understanding international politics. No one will magnify this document and see it as realistic and implementable except one who is deceived by the heading (Trump is a merchant). It is the intended, deliberate deception to which we will all submit at first glance, before we begin to dive into the depths of policy-making!

The military complex is not weak. And the military complex will not leave the real existential dangers in the world that threaten the United States and run after Brazil, Mexico, Argentina and Venezuela. This I do not buy; the Europeans know that, the Chinese know that, and the Russians know that! As for the other bodies that rule the United States, they too will share the same view with the military complex.

This document can be passed off on the peoples; the peoples and the lame news channels will say the same first paragraphs that I wrote at the start of this post, and will repeat these same phrases that look at the document as a truthful, real and serious document! But when was dealing with international politics like this? When did the makers of international politics believe everything they hear? And believe everything they read? And believe everything that is sent to them? Had the matter been so, not a single empire would have arisen in history! Politics and policy-making are not done by your merely being told something, then believing it and building on what you are told! This is a conduct and a way of thinking that has nothing to do with the strategic dimensions in building the elements of understanding and perception. This is adolescence in policy-making, an emotional drift, and a failure to conceive the truth that a person in policy-making is not a lecturer at a university presenting an abstract science!""")
